[36m(TaskRunner pid=3412925)[0m code='\ndef amicable_numbers_sum(n):\n    amicable_numbers = set()\n    for m in range(1, n + 1):\n        s = sum_of_proper_divisors(m)\n        if (s not in amicable_numbers) and (m not in amicable_numbers):\n            amicable_numbers.add(s)\n            amicable_numbers.add(m)\n    return sum(amicable_numbers)\n\ndef sum_of_proper_divisors(m):\n    s = 0\n    for i in range(2, int(math.sqrt(m)) + 1):\n        if m % i == 0:\n            s += i\n            if m // i != i:\n                s += m // i\n    return s\n\n# Example usage\nresult = amicable_numbers_sum(100)\nprint(result)\n'[33m(raylet)[0m [2025-09-18 13:35:32,536 E 3405271 3405300] (raylet) file_system_monitor.cc:116: /data2/Users/aghyad/tmp/ray/session_2025-09-18_12-27-53_892904_3403911 is over 95% full, available space: 413.439 GB; capacity: 14304 GB. Object creation will fail if spilling is required.
